		<description><![CDATA[<p>Madonna raises her voice again for peace in the Middle East, supporting dignity of innocent children of Gaza. The new [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-calls-for-ceasefire-in-gaza/20140723">Madonna calls for ceasefire in Gaza: No one has the right to destroy children of Gaza</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna new album news unapologetic</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Madonna</strong> raises her voice again for peace in the Middle East, supporting dignity of <strong>innocent children of Gaza</strong>. The new Madonna calls for ceasefire in <strong>Gaza</strong> caused a lot of bashing on her. So the Queen of Pop pointed out that she is not supporting <strong>Hamas</strong>, but peace and human dignity.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>These flowers are like the innocent children of <strong>GAZA</strong>! Who has a right to destroy them? No One!!!! CEASE FIRE! Peace in the Middle East.</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Madonna</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<a href="http://instagram.com/p/qzVXQamEZ2"><img src="http://photos-h.ak.instagram.com/hphotos-ak-xpf1/10561193_1521025814777783_418350161_n.jpg" alt="These flowers are like the innocent children of GAZA!  Who has a right to destroy them? No One!!!! CEASE FIRE! #peaceinthemiddleeast" width="640" height="640" /></a>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>I do not support <strong>Hamas</strong>! I support human dignity and respect! I support sharing! I support Peace! Cease fire.</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Madonna</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<a href="http://instagram.com/p/qzdDMEmEW-"><img src="http://photos-f.ak.instagram.com/hphotos-ak-xaf1/10561128_1439636986309581_2072091043_n.jpg" alt="I do not support Hamas! I support human dignity and respect! I support sharing! I support Peace! #ceasefire" width="640" height="640" /></a>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-calls-for-ceasefire-in-gaza/20140723">Madonna calls for ceasefire in Gaza: No one has the right to destroy children of Gaza</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna new album news unapologetic</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
