				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Madonna calls for peace in the Middle East</strong>. She urges both sides to cease fire. &#8220;<span class="userContent">Conflicts can never be resolved through violence</span>,&#8221; says <strong>Madonna</strong>.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>All human life is valuable! Stop the violence!</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Madonna</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p>Madonna made two consecutive posts urging an end to the violence, using the ashtag #revolutionoflove. The first post was accompanied by a picture of the 16-year-old Palestinian boy who was kidnapped and found dead. The second post was accompanied by a picture of the three young Israeli yeshiva students who were found dead.</p>
