		<description><![CDATA[<p>Boxing legend Thomas Hearns praises Madonna and describes her as a hero in the boxing community for saving Detroit Downtown [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/thomas-hearns-praises-madonna-hero-boxing-community/20140706">Thomas Hearns praises Madonna: &#8220;A hero for the boxing community&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna new album news unapologetic</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Boxing legend <strong>Thomas Hearns praises Madonna</strong> and describes her as a hero in the boxing community for saving Detroit Downtown Youth Boxing Gym.</p>
<p>The gym&#8217;s main building was condemned, so <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s donation will allow the place to make renovations and continue to operate.</p>
<p>Talking with TMZ, <strong>Thomas Hearns</strong> &#8211; who grew up in <strong>Detroit</strong> &#8211; says that <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s generosity will have a huge impact with young boxers and the community as a whole.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>I think it&#8217;s awesome for her to help, being as big as she is. The people who get the help she provides will probably shed tears.</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Thomas Hearns</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p><strong>Thomas Hearns</strong> hopes that <strong>Madonna</strong> will inspire other successful <strong>Detroit</strong> natives to give back. &#8220;They should do as much as they can,&#8221; <strong>Thomas</strong> says. &#8220;It&#8217;s where they came from, and it&#8217;s not a great situation right now.&#8221;</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/thomas-hearns-praises-madonna-hero-boxing-community/20140706">Thomas Hearns praises Madonna: &#8220;A hero for the boxing community&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna new album news unapologetic</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
