		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-donating-funds-to-detroit-groups-fighting-poverty-2014/20140630</link>
		<comments>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-donating-funds-to-detroit-groups-fighting-poverty-2014/20140630#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2014 23:14:46 +0000</pubDate>
