				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Madonna is building a school for women in Mali</strong>. And it is almost finished, according to one of her latest posts on Instagram.<br />
The <strong>secondary school for women in Mali</strong> is being built by <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s Ray of Light Foundation along with BuildOn. <strong>Madonna</strong> is proud to say that the <strong>school for women</strong> is actually built by <strong>women</strong>.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>Built by women in <strong>Mali</strong>.</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Madonna</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p>Well done <strong>Madonna</strong>!</p>
